@startuml US2.2.11 - System Sequence Diagram
actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "Port System" as System

' Register new staff member
activate Operator
Operator -> System : Request to register new staff member
activate System
System --> Operator : Display staff registration form
deactivate System

Operator -> System : Submit staff data (mecanographic number, name, contact details, qualifications, operational window, status)
activate System
System --> Operator : Validate data and create staff member
System --> Operator : Display confirmation of successful registration
deactivate System

' Update existing staff member
Operator -> System : Request to update staff member
activate System
System --> Operator : Display list of staff members
deactivate System

Operator -> System : Select staff member to update
activate System
System --> Operator : Display staff member details form
deactivate System

Operator -> System : Submit updated staff data (contact details, qualifications, operational window, status)
activate System
System --> Operator : Validate updates and save changes
System --> Operator : Display confirmation of successful update
deactivate System

' Deactivate staff member
Operator -> System : Request to deactivate staff member
activate System
System --> Operator : Display list of active staff members
deactivate System

Operator -> System : Select staff member to deactivate
activate System
System --> Operator : Request deactivation confirmation
deactivate System

Operator -> System : Confirm deactivation
activate System
System --> Operator : Preserve data and mark as deactivated
System --> Operator : Display confirmation of deactivation
deactivate System

' Reactivate staff member
Operator -> System : Request to reactivate staff member
activate System
System --> Operator : Display list of deactivated staff members
deactivate System

Operator -> System : Select staff member to reactivate
activate System
System --> Operator : Restore active status
System --> Operator : Display confirmation of reactivation
deactivate System

' Search and filter staff members
Operator -> System : Apply search/filter criteria (ID, name, status, qualifications)
activate System
System --> Operator : Display filtered staff member list
deactivate System

' View staff member details
Operator -> System : Select specific staff member to view details
activate System
System --> Operator : Display complete staff member information (ID, name, contact, qualifications, operational window, status)
deactivate System

deactivate Operator

@enduml